# qemu: -acpitable file=@SSDT@ -smbios type=2,manufacturer=HP,product=8A4E
# The emulator answers every call, so the module loads, writable by default, and reports what it was told.
# A broken _WDG fails here instead of passing as ENODEV.
load
info kbd_type
info readonly
info header
read zones
read backlight
info backlight_raw
kmsg keyboard type 2
unload
kmsg-clean
